121	/* Per-command gate for the VelaGuard tools.  This has to live in C rather
122	 * than in the skill text: these commands are reachable through the generic
123	 * run_shell tool, and vgstats inject/reset mutate frame counters, vgnet
124	 * inject/wifi rewrite network policy, and vgruntime report <path> writes an
125	 * arbitrary file.
126	 *
127	 *   subcmd == NULL  read-only by construction, the whole command is fine
128	 *   subcmd == ""    no subcommand is permitted at all
129	 *   otherwise       the first token after the command must equal subcmd   */
